.TH GRID_RENDER 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
grid_render \- Draw the background of every visible cell, a grey outline round each, and the selected one outlined in color_selected
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqgrid.h\(dq
.BI "void grid_render(const Grid *g);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Draw the background of every visible cell, a grey outline round each, and the selected one outlined in color_selected. Call from render after the backdrop and before drawing the cell contents at grid_cell_rect; skip it and draw your own cells if the look does not suit.
.SH MODULE
grid (src/engine/grid/grid.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR grid_render_scrollbar (3),
.BR grid_cell_rect (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
